add(card,'p','Only the latest 40 matching messages from the past 14 days are listed. Message text is read only for the emails you select (up to 10). Attachments are not opened. Mail, sources and tokens are held in memory and are not sent to an AI service. Closing/reloading clears them. Saving a comparison retains only its reviewed title and minimal source reference in your local decision history.','helper');
const searchLabel=add(card,'label','Optional Gmail search');searchLabel.htmlFor='gmailContextSearch';const query=add(card,'input');query.id='gmailContextSearch';query.maxLength=300;query.placeholder='For example: invitation OR workshop OR subject:deadline';
